(*---
description: Checks state_predicate on the choice machine under unfair fairness.
ref: tlc2/tool/liveness/LiveCheck.java; tlc2/tool/liveness/Liveness.java
features:
  - liveness
outcome: any
config: |
  SPECIFICATION Spec
  PROPERTY Prop
  CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
---*)
---- MODULE live_choice__unfair__state_predicate ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLE x
Next == \/ x = 0 /\ x' \in {1, 2}
        \/ x = 1 /\ x' = 1
        \/ x = 2 /\ x' = 0
Spec == x = 0 /\ [][Next]_x
Prop == x = 0
====

